First release.

Send a party of heroes ever deeper into a dungeon with no bottom. They fight on their own — you decide who to level, what to forge, and when to give it all up and Rebirth for permanent Ember upgrades.

Progress keeps running while the app is closed, so there is always something waiting when you come back.

A boss every 100 floors, a forge for upgrading gear, tiered achievements, and daily login rewards.

Ads are always optional: watch one for a bonus, or don't.
